 data-end=\\u0022741\\u0022\\u003e2 hours\\u003c/strong\\u003e to Chiquilá + \\u003cstrong data-start=\\u0022756\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022784\\u0022\\u003e30-minute ferry crossing\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp data-start=\\u00221081\\u0022 data-end=\\u00221275\\u0022\\u003eWhether you choose a Standard or VIP service, you\'ll enjoy the privacy, flexibility and comfort of traveling on your own schedule without waiting for other passengers or making multiple stops.\\u003cimg class=\\u0022alignnone size-medium wp-image-1047\\u0022 src=\\u0022https://flightsholboxv1.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/B91A65FD-CBDB-4420-953C-D85B8141A27D-300x240.webp\\u0022 alt=\\u0022\\u0022 width=\\u0022300\\u0022 height=\\u0022240\\u0022 /\\u003e\\u003cimg class=\\u0022alignnone size-medium wp-image-1048\\u0022 src=\\u0022https://flightsholboxv1.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/529E9A91-924F-41AC-BE7C-473AAF268E52-300x200.webp\\u0022 alt=\\u0022\\u0022 width=\\u0022300\\u0022 height=\\u0022200\\u0022 /\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"_intro\":\"field_6a4e7a9548edd\",\"background_colour\":\"\",\"_background_colour\":\"field_69fb291d7099f\",\"container_size\":\"\",\"_container_size\":\"field_6a104fa067637\",\"panel_settings\":\"\",\"_panel_settings\":\"field_6a4e7a9c48ede\"},\"mode\":\"edit\"} /-->','Latest News','','inherit','closed','closed','','323-revision-v1','','','2026-07-24 23:42:27','2026-07-24 22:42:27','',323,'https://flightsholboxv1.local/?p=1049',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (1051,2,'2026-07-24 23:44:17','2026-07-24 22:44:17','<!-- wp:acf/hero-panel {\"name\":\"acf/hero-panel\",\"data\":{\"hero_slides_0_slide_image\":838,\"_hero_slides_0_slide_image\":\"field_6a465a86ac589\",\"hero_slides_1_slide_image\":\"\",\"_hero_slides_1_slide_image\":\"field_6a465a86ac589\",\"hero_slides\":2,\"_hero_slides\":\"field_6a465a79ac588\",\"hero_heading\":\"How To Get To Holbox \",\"_hero_heading\":\"field_6a465aa9ac58a\",\"hero_intro\":\"Travel Guide\",\"_hero_intro\":\"field_6a465ab2ac58b\"},\"mode\":\"edit\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:acf/news-gallery-panel {\"name\":\"acf/news-gallery-panel\",\"data\":{\"heading\":\"How to get to Holbox Travel  Guide \",\"_heading\":\"field_6a4e7a8748edc\",\"intro\":\"\\u003cp class=\\u0022PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\\u0022 data-start=\\u0022814\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022842\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong data-start=\\u0022814\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022842\\u0022\\u003ePrivate Flight to Holbox\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp data-start=\\u0022814\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022842\\u0022\\u003e⏱️ \\u003cstrong data-start=\\u0022695\\u0022 data-end=\\u0022711\\u0022\\u003eTravel Time:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Approximately \\u003cstrong\\u003e30mins\\u003c/strong\\u003e to Holbox\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp data-start=\\u0022847\\u0022 data-end=\\u00221207\\u0022\\u003eA private flight is the fastest and most comfortable way to reach Holbox. Flights from Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Tulum or Cozumel take approximately 30 minutes and land directly on the island, avoiding the drive to Chiquilá and the ferry crossing. Flights Holbox operates private charter flights with experienced commercial pilots and professionally maintained aircraft for up to five passengers.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp data-start=\\u00221212\\u0022 data-end=\\u00221378\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong data-start=\\u00221212\\u0022 data-end=\\u00221263\\u0022\\u003ePrices start at $840 USD per aircraft (one way)\\u003c/strong\\u003e,